<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head', { title: title }) %>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<h1>OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications</h1>
<div class="challenge-grid">
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM01: Prompt Injection</h3><form method="POST" action="/llm/llm01/chat"><input name="message" placeholder="Chat with AI"><button>Send</button></form></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM02: Insecure Output</h3><p><a href="#" onclick="prompt('POST /llm/llm02/execute with code')">Execute LLM Code</a></p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM03: Training Poison</h3><p><a href="/llm/llm03/poisoned-data">View Poisoned Data</a></p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM04: Model DoS</h3><p>POST /llm/llm04/chat (large payloads)</p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM05: Supply Chain</h3><p><a href="/llm/llm05/models">Model Inventory</a></p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM06: Sensitive Data</h3><p>POST /llm/llm06/chat (PII exposure)</p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM07: Plugin Design</h3><p>POST /llm/llm07/plugin/execute</p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM08: Agency</h3><p>POST /llm/llm08/assistant</p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM09: Overreliance</h3><p>POST /llm/llm09/decide</p></div>
<div class="challenge-card"><h3>LLM10: Model Theft</h3><p><a href="/llm/llm10/model-info">Model Architecture</a></p></div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
